  "title": "How ASRV Saves a Massive Amount of Hours Using 42",
  "summary": "“Per project, we are saving hours every time. Literally, we are saving hours each time we use 42 for our data analytics,” said David. “Calculating size breaks, pulling sell-through data on all sizes and styles; in Shopify that would have taken hours. In 42, we have an answer in thirty seconds.”",
